        "payload": "tree 46b792b0297d86a0ad7ba8a029396344453de1c3\nparent ddea9196493d3b8fd841a36a6c53efd85dac7a05\nauthor Peter Zafonte <pzafonte@pm.me> 1794570524 +0900\ncommitter Peter Zafonte <pzafonte@pm.me> 1794578530 +0900\n\nkernel: destroy chainstate manager first\n\nChainMan declares m_context last, which destroys it before the\nChainstateManager that refers into it. Reset the chainstate manager\nexplicitly, making the order independent of member declaration order.\n",
